---
---

<section class="viz-section">
  <div class="viz-preview">
    <img
      src="/viz.png"
      alt="Grafik langit visibilitas hilal — malam penentuan 1 Rajab 1448 H, diputuskan di Tuapejat"
      width="280"
      height="498"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <img
      src="/map.png"
      alt="Peta wilayah visibilitas hilal Indonesia — malam penentuan 1 Rajab 1448 H"
      width="280"
      height="498"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="viz-content">
    <h2>Visualisasi <span class="accent">Hilal</span></h2>
    <p>
      Bukan hanya sistem tanggal, kami juga menyajikan gambar visibilitas hilal.
      Endpoint <code>/hilal/viz</code> merender grafik langit 720×1280 dan
      <code>/hilal/map</code> merender peta wilayah visibilitas seluruh Nusantara
      untuk malam penentuan.
    </p>
    <p>
      Semua dihitung dengan kriteria Neo MABIMS yang dievaluasi di titik-titik
      pengamatan di seluruh Indonesia.
    </p>
    <div class="viz-endpoints">
      <div class="viz-endpoint">
        <span class="viz-method">GET</span>
        <code class="viz-url">/api/v1/hilal/viz?month=7&year=1448</code>
      </div>
      <div class="viz-endpoint">
        <span class="viz-method">GET</span>
        <code class="viz-url">/api/v1/hilal/map?month=7&year=1448</code>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .viz-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-template-areas:
      "content"
      "preview";
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .viz-section {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-areas: "preview content";
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .viz-content {
    grid-area: content;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .viz-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .viz-content h2 .accent {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }

  .viz-content p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.5rem + 1vw, 1.125rem);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .viz-content code {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    background: rgba(254, 207, 70, 0.1);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .viz-endpoints {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .viz-endpoint {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .viz-method {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
    color: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .viz-url {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .viz-preview {
    grid-area: preview;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .viz-preview img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background: #1f1235;
  }
</style>
